INSERT INTO `articles` VALUES (1,'Top 5 m├│n ─æß║╖c sß║ún kh├┤ng thß╗â bß╗Å lß╗í khi ─æß║┐n ─Éß║»k Lß║»k','Top 5 Must-Try Specialties in Dak Lak','top-5-mon-dac-san-dak-lak','Kh├ím ph├í ß║⌐m thß╗▒c T├óy Nguy├¬n qua nhß╗»ng m├│n ─ân ─æß║¡m chß║Ñt n├║i rß╗½ng: G├á n╞░ß╗¢ng bß║ún ─É├┤n, B├║n ─æß╗Å, Gß╗Åi l├í, R╞░ß╗úu cß║ºn...','From grilled chicken with bamboo rice to red noodle soup, explore the unique flavors of the Central Highlands.','<p>─Éß║»k Lß║»k kh├┤ng chß╗ë nß╗òi tiß║┐ng vß╗¢i nhß╗»ng c├ính rß╗½ng bß║ít ng├án, nhß╗»ng ngß╗ìn th├íc h├╣ng v─⌐ m├á c├▓n bß╗ƒi n├⌐t v─ân h├│a ß║⌐m thß╗▒c ─æß╗Öc ─æ├ío. D╞░ß╗¢i ─æ├óy l├á 5 m├│n ─æß║╖c sß║ún bß║ín nhß║Ñt ─æß╗ïnh phß║úi thß╗¡ khi ─æß║┐n v├╣ng ─æß║Ñt n├áy:</p>\n                      <h3>1. G├á n╞░ß╗¢ng Bß║ún ─É├┤n</h3>\n                      <p>G├á ─æ╞░ß╗úc nu├┤i thß║ú r├┤ng tr├¬n ─æß╗ôi n├║i, thß╗ït chß║»c v├á th╞ím. G├á sau khi l├ám sß║ích ─æ╞░ß╗úc tß║⌐m ╞░ß╗¢p vß╗¢i muß╗æi ß╗¢t sß║ú, mß║¡t ong rß╗½ng rß╗ôi n╞░ß╗¢ng tr├¬n than hß╗ông. ─én k├¿m vß╗¢i c╞ím lam dß║╗o th╞ím th├¼ kh├┤ng c├▓n g├¼ tuyß╗çt vß╗¥i bß║▒ng.</p>\n                      <h3>2. B├║n ─æß╗Å Bu├┤n Ma Thuß╗Öt</h3>\n                      <p>Mß╗Öt t├┤ b├║n ─æß╗Å rß╗▒c rß╗í vß╗¢i n╞░ß╗¢c d├╣ng ngß╗ìt thanh tß╗½ x╞░╞íng, cua ─æß╗ông gi├ú nhß╗Å, thß╗ït b─âm, trß╗⌐ng c├║t... Sß╗úi b├║n to, dai gi├▓n, ─æ╞░ß╗úc nhuß╗Öm m├áu ─æß╗Å tß╗▒ nhi├¬n tß╗½ hß║ít ─æiß╗üu, ─ân c├╣ng rau cß║ºn n╞░ß╗¢c, cß║úi ngß╗ìt luß╗Öc.</p>\n                      <h3>3. Gß╗Åi l├í</h3>\n                      <p>M├│n ─ân l├á sß╗▒ kß║┐t hß╗úp cß╗ºa h╞ín 40 loß║íi l├í rß╗½ng kh├íc nhau, cuß╗Ön c├╣ng thß╗ït ba chß╗ë luß╗Öc, t├┤m rang, da heo th├íi mß╗Ång... Chß║Ñm c├╣ng thß╗⌐ n╞░ß╗¢c chß║Ñm sß╗ün sß╗çt ─æß║╖c chß║┐ tß╗½ h├¿m r╞░ß╗úu, trß╗⌐ng vß╗ït, thß╗ït b─âm.</p>\n                      <h3>4. R╞░ß╗úu cß║ºn</h3>\n                      <p>Thß╗⌐c uß╗æng truyß╗ün thß╗æng cß╗ºa ─æß╗ông b├áo d├ón tß╗Öc thiß╗âu sß╗æ T├óy Nguy├¬n. R╞░ß╗úu ─æ╞░ß╗úc ß╗º men l├í rß╗½ng, c├│ vß╗ï ngß╗ìt nß╗ông ß║Ñm, ─æ╞░ß╗úc uß╗æng trß╗▒c tiß║┐p tß╗½ ch├│e bß║▒ng nhß╗»ng cß║ºn tr├║c d├ái.</p>\n                      <h3>5. C├á ph├¬ Bu├┤n Ma Thuß╗Öt</h3>\n                      <p>Tß║Ñt nhi├¬n, ─æß║┐n \"thß╗º phß╗º c├á ph├¬\" th├¼ kh├┤ng thß╗â bß╗Å qua mß╗Öt ly c├á ph├¬ ─æß║¡m ─æ├á, th╞ím lß╗½ng. C├á ph├¬ ß╗ƒ ─æ├óy c├│ h╞░╞íng vß╗ï ─æß║╖c tr╞░ng, ─æ├ính thß╗⌐c mß╗ìi gi├íc quan.</p>','Dak Lak is not only famous for its majestic nature but also for its rich and unique cuisine. Here are the must-try dishes:<br><br>1. **Grilled Chicken with Bamboo Rice (C╞ím lam g├á n╞░ß╗¢ng):** A signature dish of the local people.<br>2. **Red Noodle Soup (B├║n ─æß╗Å):** A popular street food in Buon Ma Thuot.<br>3. **Venison (Thß╗ït nai):** A specialty often served as a gift.<br><br>Don\'t miss the chance to taste these amazing flavors!','/travel_daklak/main/assets/images/article_1_food.png',1,'published','2026-07-07 07:29:54'),(2,'Kinh nghiß╗çm du lß╗ïch Bß║úo t├áng Thß║┐ giß╗¢i C├á ph├¬ 2024','Tips for Visiting The World Coffee Museum','kinh-nghiem-du-lich-bao-tang-the-gioi-ca-phe','Bß║úo t├áng Thß║┐ giß╗¢i C├á ph├¬ kh├┤ng chß╗ë l├á n╞íi l╞░u giß╗» lß╗ïch sß╗¡ vß╗ü c├á ph├¬ m├á c├▓n l├á mß╗Öt kiß╗çt t├íc kiß║┐n tr├║c ─æß╗Öc ─æ├ío, ─æiß╗âm check-in cß╗▒c \"hot\" tß║íi Bu├┤n Ma Thuß╗Öt.','Everything you need to know before visiting this iconic architectural landmark.','<p>─É╞░ß╗úc mß╗çnh danh l├á \"Ch├óu ├éu thu nhß╗Å giß╗»a l├▓ng Bu├┤n Ma Thuß╗Öt\", <strong>Bß║úo t├áng Thß║┐ giß╗¢i C├á ph├¬</strong> l├á mß╗Öt ─æiß╗âm ─æß║┐n kh├┤ng thß╗â bß╗Å qua ─æß╗æi vß╗¢i bß║Ñt kß╗│ ai ─æß║╖t ch├ón ─æß║┐n ─Éß║»k Lß║»k.</p>\n                      <h3>Kiß║┐n tr├║c ─æß╗Öc ─æ├ío</h3>\n                      <p>Bß║úo t├áng c├│ kiß║┐n tr├║c lß║Ñy cß║úm hß╗⌐ng tß╗½ kh├┤ng gian nh├á d├ái truyß╗ün thß╗æng cß╗ºa ─æß╗ông b├áo T├óy Nguy├¬n, kß║┐t hß╗úp vß╗¢i nhß╗»ng ─æ╞░ß╗¥ng n├⌐t uß╗æn l╞░ß╗ún hiß╗çn ─æß║íi. Kh├┤ng gian mß╗ƒ, ─æ├│n ├ính s├íng tß╗▒ nhi├¬n, tß║ío cß║úm gi├íc v├┤ c├╣ng tho├íng ─æ├úng.</p>\n                      <h3>Kh├ím ph├í lß╗ïch sß╗¡ c├á ph├¬</h3>\n                      <p>B├¬n trong bß║úo t├áng l├á kh├┤ng gian tr╞░ng b├áy h╞ín 10.000 hiß╗çn vß║¡t li├¬n quan ─æß║┐n c├á ph├¬ tß╗½ khß║»p n╞íi tr├¬n thß║┐ giß╗¢i. Bß║ín sß║╜ ─æ╞░ß╗úc t├¼m hiß╗âu vß╗ü nguß╗ôn gß╗æc, lß╗ïch sß╗¡, v─ân h├│a c├á ph├¬ qua c├íc thß╗¥i kß╗│, c┼⌐ng nh╞░ quy tr├¼nh sß║ún xuß║Ñt c├á ph├¬ tß╗½ hß║ít ─æß║┐n ly.</p>\n                      <h3>G├│c check-in \"triß╗çu view\"</h3>\n                      <p>Mß╗ìi ng├│c ng├ích trong bß║úo t├áng ─æß╗üu c├│ thß╗â trß╗ƒ th├ánh bß╗æi cß║únh tuyß╗çt vß╗¥i cho nhß╗»ng bß╗⌐c ß║únh \"sß╗æng ß║úo\". Tß╗½ kiß║┐n tr├║c b├¬n ngo├ái, kh├┤ng gian tr╞░ng b├áy b├¬n trong, ─æß║┐n nhß╗»ng qu├ín c├á ph├¬ mang phong c├ích hiß╗çn ─æß║íi.</p>\n                      <p><strong>L╞░u ├╜:</strong> H├úy chß╗ìn cho m├¼nh nhß╗»ng trang phß╗Ñc vintage hoß║╖c phong c├ích n─âng ─æß╗Öng ─æß╗â c├│ nhß╗»ng bß╗⌐c ß║únh \"hß╗úp cß║únh\" nhß║Ñt nh├⌐!</p>','The World Coffee Museum is a must-visit spot. Here are some tips for your trip:<br><br>- **Best time to visit:** Early morning or late afternoon for the best lighting.<br>- **Tickets:** Buy tickets online or at the counter.<br>- **What to do:** Explore the exhibitions, taste the coffee, and take stunning photos with the unique architecture.<br><br>Enjoy your time in the coffee capital!','/travel_daklak/main/assets/images/article_2_museum.png',1,'published','2026-07-07 07:29:54'),(3,'Lß╗ïch tr├¼nh 3 ng├áy 2 ─æ├¬m ph╞░ß╗út ─Éß║»k Lß║»k trß╗ìn vß║╣n','3 Days 2 Nights Backpacking Itinerary in Dak Lak','lich-trinh-3-ngay-2-dem-phuot-dak-lak','Gß╗úi ├╜ lß╗ïch tr├¼nh ph╞░ß╗út ─Éß║»k Lß║»k 3 ng├áy 2 ─æ├¬m chi tiß║┐t nhß║Ñt, ─æi qua nhß╗»ng ─æß╗ïa ─æiß╗âm nß╗òi tiß║┐ng: Hß╗ô Lß║»k, Th├íc Dray Nur, L├áng c├á ph├¬ Trung Nguy├¬n...','A detailed itinerary for a perfect weekend getaway in the Central Highlands.','<p>Bß║ín ─æang l├¬n kß║┐ hoß║ích ph╞░ß╗út ─Éß║»k Lß║»k trong 3 ng├áy 2 ─æ├¬m? D╞░ß╗¢i ─æ├óy l├á gß╗úi ├╜ lß╗ïch tr├¼nh chi tiß║┐t gi├║p bß║ín kh├ím ph├í trß╗ìn vß║╣n vß║╗ ─æß║╣p cß╗ºa v├╣ng ─æß║Ñt T├óy Nguy├¬n ─æß║ºy nß║»ng v├á gi├│.</p>\n                      <h3>Ng├áy 1: Kh├ím ph├í th├ánh phß╗æ Bu├┤n Ma Thuß╗Öt</h3>\n                      <ul>\n                          <li><strong>S├íng:</strong> ─Éß║┐n Bu├┤n Ma Thuß╗Öt, th╞░ß╗ƒng thß╗⌐c b├║n ─æß╗Å. Tham quan Bß║úo t├áng ─Éß║»k Lß║»k, t├¼m hiß╗âu v─ân h├│a c├íc d├ón tß╗Öc.</li>\n                          <li><strong>Chiß╗üu:</strong> Tham quan L├áng c├á ph├¬ Trung Nguy├¬n, th╞░ß╗ƒng thß╗⌐c c├á ph├¬ v├á check-in kh├┤ng gian kiß║┐n tr├║c ─æß╗Öc ─æ├ío.</li>\n                          <li><strong>Tß╗æi:</strong> Dß║ío quanh Quß║úng tr╞░ß╗¥ng 10/3, th╞░ß╗ƒng thß╗⌐c ß║⌐m thß╗▒c ─æ╞░ß╗¥ng phß╗æ, mua sß║»m ─æß╗ô l╞░u niß╗çm.</li>\n                      </ul>\n                      <h3>Ng├áy 2: Chinh phß╗Ñc th├íc n╞░ß╗¢c v├á kh├ím ph├í Hß╗ô Lß║»k</h3>\n                      <ul>\n                          <li><strong>S├íng:</strong> Di chuyß╗ân ─æß║┐n Th├íc Dray Nur - Dray Sap, chi├¬m ng╞░ß╗íng vß║╗ ─æß║╣p h├╣ng v─⌐ cß╗ºa d├▓ng th├íc ─æß╗ò. Tß║»m th├íc, tham gia c├íc hoß║ít ─æß╗Öng trekking nhß║╣ nh├áng.</li>\n                          <li><strong>Chiß╗üu:</strong> Di chuyß╗ân ─æß║┐n Hß╗ô Lß║»k, hß╗ô n╞░ß╗¢c ngß╗ìt tß╗▒ nhi├¬n lß╗¢n thß╗⌐ hai Viß╗çt Nam. Ngß╗ôi thuyß╗ün ─æß╗Öc mß╗Öc ngß║»m cß║únh hß╗ô, c╞░ß╗íi voi, th─âm bu├┤n l├áng cß╗ºa ng╞░ß╗¥i M\'N├┤ng.</li>\n                          <li><strong>Tß╗æi:</strong> Th╞░ß╗ƒng thß╗⌐c c├íc m├│n n╞░ß╗¢ng ven hß╗ô, th╞░ß╗ƒng thß╗⌐c r╞░ß╗úu cß║ºn v├á h├▓a m├¼nh v├áo kh├┤ng gian v─ân h├│a cß╗ông chi├¬ng.</li>\n                      </ul>\n                      <h3>Ng├áy 3: Kh├ím ph├í Bu├┤n ─É├┤n v├á trß╗ƒ vß╗ü</h3>\n                      <ul>\n                          <li><strong>S├íng:</strong> ─Éß║┐n Bu├┤n ─É├┤n, tham quan cß║ºu treo thanh ni├¬n, nh├á s├án cß╗ò. Trß║úi nghiß╗çm c╞░ß╗íi voi lß╗Öi s├┤ng S├¬r├¬pß╗æk.</li>\n                          <li><strong>Tr╞░a:</strong> Th╞░ß╗ƒng thß╗⌐c ─æß║╖c sß║ún G├á n╞░ß╗¢ng Bß║ún ─É├┤n, c╞ím lam.</li>\n                          <li><strong>Chiß╗üu:</strong> Mua sß║»m ─æß║╖c sß║ún (c├á ph├¬, hß║ít ti├¬u, mß║¡t ong rß╗½ng...) l├ám qu├á. Kß║┐t th├║c h├ánh tr├¼nh 3 ng├áy 2 ─æ├¬m ─æß║ºy th├║ vß╗ï.</li>\n                      </ul>\n                      <p><em>L╞░u ├╜: Lß╗ïch tr├¼nh c├│ thß╗â linh hoß║ít thay ─æß╗òi t├╣y theo sß╗ƒ th├¡ch v├á ─æiß╗üu kiß╗çn thß╗¥i tiß║┐t thß╗▒c tß║┐.</em></p>','If you only have a weekend, here is the perfect itinerary:<br><br>- **Day 1:** Explore Buon Ma Thuot city, visit the Coffee Museum, and enjoy local food.<br>- **Day 2:** Visit Dray Nur and Dray Sap waterfalls, then head to Lak Lake for sunset.<br>- **Day 3:** Ride elephants in Buon Don and head back home.<br><br>Enjoy your trip!','/travel_daklak/main/assets/images/article_3_waterfall.png',1,'published','2026-07-07 07:29:54');
